54e3c2cac0cf2798ecc004ceaa53.600x338.jpg?t=1749503675"}],"short_description":"Tiny Vending Machines is an idle pixel art game that runs at the bottom of your screen. Buy and upgrade vending machines, stock them with drinks, snacks, and more, and keep customers happy. Automate your machines at higher levels and grow your vending empire while you work or study!","steam_appid":3595460,"support_info":{"email":"contact@frozenlogicstudios.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":null}